ule cannot fire.\",\n          \"met\": \"no\",\n          \"evidence\": \"agent.py:45\",\n          \"quote\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"metadata rejected\\\")\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"\",\n          \"note\": \"Rejected metadata raises with no log or event record (also agent.py:66 name conflict). Denied calls are never logged, so a repeated-denied-calls rule cannot fire. No rules exist for encoded payloads, egress, out-of-scope writes or privilege escalation in this repo.\",\n          \"coverage\": [],\n          \"deviations\": [],\n          \"attempts\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"R08.3\",\n          \"check\": \"Alerts from these rules route to a named responder or on-call target in config.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Find alert routing (PagerDuty, Opsgenie, alertmanager receivers, on-call config). 2) Check the security rules route to a named responder. 3) Answer no if alerts go only to a dashboard or log, or the receiver is empty. Answer unknown if routing lives outside this repo.\",\n          \"met\": \"unknown\",\n          \"evidence\": \"\",\n          \"quote\": \"\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"\",\n          \"note\": \"No alert routing, on-call, or receiver config in the repo. Routing may live outside the repo.\",\n          \"coverage\": [],\n          \"deviations\": [],\n          \"attempts\": []\n        }\n      ],\n      \"red_flags_found\": [\n        \"agent.py:45 Denied/rejected metadata raises ValueError without any audit record, so denied-call detection cannot fire\"\n      ],\n      \"violates\": [\n        \"Test encoded payloads, unexpected outbound traffic, writes outside scope, privilege escalation, and repeated denied calls\"\n      ],\n      \"also_affects\": [],\n      \"summary\": \"Denied calls are never logged and the repo has no security rules for the listed behaviours.\",\n      \"next_step\": \"Log denials and add security detection rules with a named responder.\",\n      \"lead_role\": \